                {
                    "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
                },
                {
                    "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
                    "markdown": "Run a Ghostty-powered terminal on your iPhone, iPad, or Apple Vision Pro. Open multiple sessions, customize your theme, and copy or share terminal output.\n\n## Features\n\n- Keep programs running after you leave the app with **Keep Sessions Running** enabled. Sessions reopen on your next launch; idle shells close when you quit.\n- Switch between tabs, lock a tab to prevent accidental input, and open multiple windows on iPad.\n- Choose from the Ghostty theme catalog and use extra keys on the software keyboard.\n- Copy terminal output as text or an image, or export it as a text file.\n- Run commands, open tabs, and read terminal output with Shortcuts.\n- View session status with Live Activities on supported devices running iOS 16.2 or later.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nRequires a jailbroken iPhone or iPad running iOS 15 or later, or a jailbroken Apple Vision Pro running visionOS 1 or later. Rootless and roothide packages are available.\n\nA separate Mac version requires macOS 13 or later and is available from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/owngoal-dev/iGhostVT/releases).\n\n[View Source](https://github.com/owngoal-dev/iGhostVT) · [Join the Community](https://discord.gg/vqhDEep2mN)",
                    "useSpacing": true
                },
